                                :............................................................................/................................................................/
                            </div>
                            <div style="font-size:11px; padding:5px; text-align:right; margin-right: 20px;">Хүлээн авсан
                                :......................................................................................................../................................................................/
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </t>
                </t>
            </t>
